      "content": "\\begin{table}[htbp]\\centering\\scriptsize\n\\def\\sym#1{\\ifmmode^{#1}\\else\\(^{#1}\\)\\fi}\n\\caption{\\textbf{Additional Control Variables}}\n\\label{addctr}\n\n\\noindent{\\justifying{This table reports the robustness check results of the association between local patent trading infrastructure and institutional ownership for a sample of Chinese A-share listed firms from 2003 to 2023, controlling for other concurrent policy shocks. To rule out alternative explanations driven by other major reforms, we include additional difference-in-difference (DID) variables. Column (1) controls for the registration system reform and price limit relaxation (*Relaxation*). Column (2) controls for the patent approval system reform (*PatentReform*). Column (3) controls for the pilot policy of promoting the combination of technology and finance (*TechFin*). Column (4) controls for the ``Broadband China'' strategy (*Broadband*). Column (5) includes all these policy variables simultaneously. The dependent variable is \\textsl{Institution}, defined as the ratio of the number of shares held by institutional investors to the total number of shares at the year-end. The main explanatory variable is \\textsl{PTC} (a dummy variable that equals one if the city where the firm is located has established a patent trading center in or before year $t$, and zero otherwise). Other control variables are aligned with Table \\ref{baseline}. The time subscripts of the control variables and the explained variable are $t$ by default. All regressions include firm, year, and city fixed effects. The robust $t$-statistics clustered by the firm are reported in parentheses. The detailed variable definitions are presented in Table \\ref{definition}. ***, **, and * denote the significance at the 1\\%, 5\\%, and 10\\% levels, respectively.\\par}}\n\\bigskip\n\n\\begin{tabularx}{\\textwidth}{lYYYYYYYY@{}}\n\\toprule\n\n                &\\multicolumn{1}{c}{(1)}         &\\multicolumn{1}{c}{(2)}         &\\multicolumn{1}{c}{(3)}         &\\multicolumn{1}{c}{(4)}         &\\multicolumn{1}{c}{(5)}         \\\\\n\\hline\\\\\nPTC          &  -0.1614\\sym{***}&  -0.1620\\sym{***}&  -0.1349\\sym{***}&  -0.1523\\sym{***}&  -0.1304\\sym{***}\\\\\n                &  (-3.84)         &  (-3.86)         &  (-3.31)         &  (-3.64)         &  (-3.20)         \\\\\nAge             &  -0.0391         &  -0.0296         &  -0.0259         &  -0.0332         &  -0.0344         \\\\\n                &  (-0.96)         &  (-0.75)         &  (-0.35)         &  (-0.84)         &  (-0.44)         \\\\\nBalance         &   0.5913\\sym{***}&   0.5791\\sym{***}&   0.6097\\sym{***}&   0.5797\\sym{***}&   0.6188\\sym{***}\\\\\n                &  (23.83)         &  (23.56)         &  (23.51)         &  (23.59)         &  (23.68)         \\\\\nIndept          &  -0.3669\\sym{**} &  -0.3640\\sym{**} &  -0.3217\\sym{*}  &  -0.3671\\sym{**} &  -0.3253\\sym{*}  \\\\\n                &  (-2.23)         &  (-2.21)         &  (-1.85)         &  (-2.23)         &  (-1.87)         \\\\\nCash            &   0.0748         &   0.0810         &   0.0871         &   0.0787         &   0.0792         \\\\\n                &   (1.09)         &   (1.18)         &   (1.22)         &   (1.15)         &   (1.11)         \\\\\nROA             &   1.1476\\sym{***}&   1.1045\\sym{***}&   1.0575\\sym{***}&   1.0968\\sym{***}&   1.0864\\sym{***}\\\\\n                &  (12.92)         &  (12.44)         &  (11.43)         &  (12.36)         &  (11.76)         \\\\\nSize            &  -0.0308\\sym{*}  &  -0.0253         &  -0.0057         &  -0.0251         &  -0.0096         \\\\\n                &  (-1.87)         &  (-1.55)         &  (-0.33)         &  (-1.54)         &  (-0.56)         \\\\\nTobinq          &  -0.1324\\sym{***}&  -0.1305\\sym{***}&  -0.1214\\sym{***}&  -0.1303\\sym{***}&  -0.1228\\sym{***}\\\\\n                & (-16.82)         & (-16.63)         & (-15.18)         & (-16.57)         & (-15.27)         \\\\\nTop1            &   3.7644\\sym{***}&   3.7035\\sym{***}&   3.8334\\sym{***}&   3.7012\\sym{***}&   3.8749\\sym{***}\\\\\n                &  (29.22)         &  (29.15)         &  (28.94)         &  (29.21)         &  (28.94)         \\\\\nDual            &   0.0459\\sym{***}&   0.0451\\sym{***}&   0.0494\\sym{***}&   0.0464\\sym{***}&   0.0511\\sym{***}\\\\\n                &   (2.80)         &   (2.75)         &   (2.81)         &   (2.83)         &   (2.92)         \\\\\nFinDev          &   0.0567\\sym{**} &   0.0592\\sym{**} &   0.0600\\sym{**} &   0.0609\\sym{**} &   0.0598\\sym{**} \\\\\n                &   (2.03)         &   (2.12)         &   (2.07)         &   (2.18)         &   (2.06)         \\\\\nInnov           &  -1.8143\\sym{***}&  -1.7856\\sym{***}&  -1.4051\\sym{***}&  -1.7121\\sym{***}&  -1.3329\\sym{***}\\\\\n                &  (-3.63)         &  (-3.57)         &  (-2.76)         &  (-3.44)         &  (-2.61)         \\\\\nOpen            &   0.6269         &   0.5655         &   0.3568         &   0.5476         &   0.4025         \\\\\n                &   (1.45)         &   (1.31)         &   (0.76)         &   (1.27)         &   (0.86)         \\\\\nGov             &  -0.1953         &  -0.2164         &  -0.4355         &  -0.2737         &  -0.4175         \\\\\n                &  (-0.66)         &  (-0.74)         &  (-1.42)         &  (-0.93)         &  (-1.36)         \\\\\nRelaxation      &   0.1676\\sym{***}&                  &                  &                  &   0.1455\\sym{***}\\\\\n                &   (6.39)         &                  &                  &                  &   (5.50)         \\\\\nPatentReform    &                  &  -0.0122         &                  &                  &  -0.0191         \\\\\n                &                  &  (-0.69)         &                  &                  &  (-1.05)         \\\\\nTechFin         &                  &                  &  -0.1618\\sym{***}&                  &  -0.1469\\sym{***}\\\\\n                &                  &                  &  (-4.95)         &                  &  (-4.48)         \\\\\nBroadband       &                  &                  &                  &  -0.0889\\sym{***}&  -0.0581\\sym{**} \\\\\n                &                  &                  &                  &  (-3.21)         &  (-2.08)         \\\\\n\\hline\nObservations    &   45,654         &   45,654         &   41,224         &   45,654         &   41,224         \\\\\nFirm FE         &      Yes         &      Yes         &      Yes         &      Yes         &      Yes         \\\\\nYear FE         &      Yes         &      Yes         &      Yes         &      Yes         &      Yes         \\\\\nCity FE         &      Yes         &      Yes         &      Yes         &      Yes         &      Yes         \\\\\nAdjusted $ R^2$ &     0.57         &     0.57         &     0.58         &     0.57         &     0.58         \\\\\n\\bottomrule\n\\end{tabularx}\n\\end{table}\n"
