      "content": "# WRDS Research Database Quick Reference\n\n## Pricing Data\n- **CRSP**: US stock price, return, volume, market cap (daily/monthly)\n- **TAQ**: High-frequency intraday trading data\n- **Compustat Global**: International stock data\n- **OptionMetrics**: Options prices, implied volatilities, Greeks (US/Europe)\n- **Markit CDS**: Credit default swap data\n- **TRACE**: US corporate bond prices and trading volume\n- **Mergent FISD**: Bond characteristics and ratings\n- **WRDS Bond Returns**: Pre-calculated bond returns (TRACE + FISD)\n- **DealScan**: Commercial loan pricing and terms\n- **Markit Securities Finance**: Short selling data\n\n## Fundamental Data\n- **Compustat NA/Global**: Balance sheet, income statement, cash flow (10-K, 10-Q)\n- **Capital IQ**: Financial statements + key developments\n- **WorldScope**: International fundamentals\n- **Orbis (Bureau van Dijk)**: Global public AND private company data\n- **WRDS Financial Ratio Suite**: Pre-calculated ratios at firm/industry level\n- **Compustat Segments**: Geographic, industry, customer segment data\n- **SDC**: M&A deals and new issues (IPO, SEO)\n- **RavenPack**: News timestamps and headlines (macro + company-specific)\n\n## Earnings and Estimates\n- **I/B/E/S**: Analyst forecasts, guidance, actual earnings (US from 1975, intl from 1987)\n- **Zacks**: Analyst forecasts, revisions, price targets, recommendations\n\n## Institutional Ownership\n- **Thomson-Reuters 13F**: Institutional holdings (S34, from 1980)\n- **TR Global Ownership**: US 13F + non-US institutional data (from 1999)\n- **FactSet 13F**: Institutional ownership (formerly LionShares)\n- **WRDS SEC 13F**: Complete filings + amendments (from 2013)\n\n## Fund Ownership\n- **TR Mutual Fund (S12)**: Equity holdings quarterly (from 1980)\n- **CRSP Mutual Fund**: Returns, NAV, expense ratios, loads (holdings from 2003)\n- **MFLINKS**: Linking table between CRSP MFDB and TR\n\n## Insider Ownership\n- **TR Insider Data**: Stock and derivative transactions (from 1986)\n- **WRDS-SEC Insider**: Complete filings + footnotes (from 2003)\n- **Audit Analytics**: Shareholder activism data\n\n## People and Governance\n- **ExecuComp**: Executive compensation (from 1992)\n- **BoardEx**: Officers and directors, networks, ownership (US/Global, from 1999)\n- **ISS (RiskMetrics)**: Board member ownership, governance provisions (from 1996)\n- **Capital IQ People Intelligence**: Executive and director profiles\n\n## ESG and CSR\n- **Sustainalytics**: ESG risk ratings\n- **RepRisk**: ESG risk incidents\n- **MSCI ESG KLD**: ESG ratings and controversies\n\n## Key Linking Tables\n- **CRSP-Compustat Merged**: Link stock data to fundamentals\n- **MFLINKS**: Link mutual fund data across CRSP and TR\n- **WRDS Linking Suite**: Cross-database identifiers\n"
